<title>UK: ANZ sets $250 mln 10-year step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>ANZ sets $250 mln 10-year step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AUSTRALIA AND NEW ZEALAND BANKING GROUP LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	SPREAD    *25 BP     MATURITY     *.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	*3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.78     FULL FEES   35 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.78</p>
<p> NOTE	 *CALL AT PAR FROM FEB 2002 WHEN MARGIN STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		 +75 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED DEAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
